---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About — Ralf Tsai"
  description="About Ralf Tsai, an oceanography graduate student, environmental educator, and creator of If No Plastic."
>
  <main class="page">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <img src="/about-profile.jpg" alt="Portrait of Chun-Hung Tsai at the Institute of Oceanography" width="200" height="200" decoding="async" />
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">About</p>
        <h1>Science, sustainability, and stories that connect people.</h1>
        <p>I'm Chun-Hung Tsai (Ralf), from Kaohsiung, Taiwan. My path from chemistry to oceanography has shaped how I explore environmental change and communicate science.</p>
        <a class="profile-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hungtsai0223/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View my LinkedIn profile ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="research" data-reveal>
      <h2>Education &amp; Research</h2>
      <div class="detail-grid">
        <article class="detail">
          <h3>National Taiwan University</h3>
          <p>Graduate studies in oceanography, focusing on anthropogenic mercury emissions, energy systems, and environmental change.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="detail">
          <h3>National Pingtung University</h3>
          <p>Applied Chemistry, with training in applied biotechnology and multiple academic excellence awards.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" data-reveal>
      <h2>What I Do</h2>
      <div class="detail-grid">
        <article class="detail">
          <h3>Environmental Education</h3>
          <p>Through <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ifnoplastic.tw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">If No Plastic</a>, I share ocean issues, plastic-free living, and everyday sustainability in accessible ways.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="detail">
          <h3>Leadership &amp; Collaboration</h3>
          <p>Former President of the Chongde Volunteer Club and Vice President of the Department Student Association, with experience in cross-disciplinary coordination.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="detail">
          <h3>Professional Experience</h3>
          <p>Internships in NGO and industry settings, including local revitalization work and TCI Co., Ltd., have helped me connect research with practice.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="detail">
          <h3>International Engagement</h3>
          <p>I participate in international science exchange through the Sakura Science Program under the Japan Science and Technology Agency (JST).</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" data-reveal>
      <h2>Recognition</h2>
      <figure class="feature-image award-image">
        <img src="/altruism-award.jpg" alt="Ralf Tsai receiving an award at National Taiwan University" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <figcaption>Altruism Award, College of Science, National Taiwan University.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="section" data-reveal>
      <h2>Beyond Research</h2>
      <p>I enjoy photography, travel, reading, Chinese prose, swimming, and yoga. These interests help me notice the world more carefully and find stories worth sharing.</p>
      <figure class="feature-image sea-image">
        <img src="/sea.jpg" alt="The sea near dusk" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <figcaption>My favorite moment is the sea just before evening—quiet, open, and full of space to think.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <a class="profile-link" href="/blog">Explore my writing →</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    display: grid;
    gap: 64px;
  }

  .about-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: start;
  }

.about-hero img {
  /* About 頁照片尺寸：想更大就改這兩個 */
  width: 200px;
  height: 200px;

  /* cover = 裁切成固定比例；適合頭像與人物照 */
  object-fit: cover;

  /* 調整裁切位置：
     center = 中央
     top = 臉部偏上時可用
     50% 35% = 更精準控制水平/垂直位置 */
  object-position: center;

  /* 圓角方形風格，像質感個人網站 */
  border-radius: 34px;

  border: 5px solid white;
  box-shadow: 0 22px 52px rgba(26, 39, 68, 0.14);
}

  .kicker {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    color: #6c88ad;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    color: #1a2744;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 50px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: #1a2744;
    font-size: 26px;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: rgba(26, 39, 68, 0.72);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  strong {
    color: #1a2744;
  }

  .section {
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .what-i-do {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
    color: rgba(26, 39, 68, 0.72);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .what-i-do li::marker {
    color: #6c88ad;
  }

  .feature-image {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .feature-image img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 26px;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 200, 240, 0.5);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 46px rgba(26, 39, 68, 0.08);
  }

  figcaption {
    color: rgba(26, 39, 68, 0.52);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .detail-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .detail {
    padding: 22px;
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(26,39,68,.12);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.54);
  }
  .detail h3 { font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
  .detail p { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .profile-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    color: #365477;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    width: fit-content;
  }
  .feature-image img { aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; object-fit: contain; background: #e4eaf0; }
  .award-image { max-width: 640px; }
  .sea-image img { object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; }

  @media screen and (max-width: 720px) {
    .page { gap: 38px; }
    .detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .detail { padding: 18px; }
    .section { gap: 8px; }
    .about-hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .about-hero img {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(30px, 8vw, 42px);
    }

    p,
    .what-i-do {
      font-size: 18px;
    }
  }
</style>